      "source_id": "da5a102b-2b56-4e00-96c1-d67a875c2a4d",
      "text": "I'll keep that in mind. Maybe I can set a reminder on my phone to check the temperature in different rooms every couple of hours. It's not too much effort, and it might help me figure out the best spot for them."
    },
    {
      "available": true,
      "role": "model_output",
      "slot": "s1",
      "source_id": "6b3f28ee-5d8a-4767-ae61-1416b423011e",
      "text": "That sounds like a great plan! Keeping a consistent routine for temperature checks will definitely help you pinpoint the best spot for your plants. Let me know how it goes!"
    },
    {
      "available": true,
      "role": "model_output",
      "slot": "s2",
      "source_id": "f602e400-6409-4e24-8807-d6b14b68793a",
      "text": "I'll start with that today. By the way, do you have any tips for keeping plants healthy during a heatwave? I'm a bit worried about the sudden temperature changes."
    },
